sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Op as Operator
  participant SIM as simulator
  participant COOL as cooling-controller
  participant SCH as scheduler
  participant WL as workload
  participant TEL as telemetry
  Op->>SIM: POST /api/sim/failures COOLING_FAILURE Z3
  SIM->>COOL: telemetry.zone.reading unitHealth FAULT
  COOL->>COOL: debounce 2 readings, mark FAULT
  COOL->>SCH: cooling.unit.state Z3 health FAULT
  COOL->>SIM: cooling.unit.state healthy zones floor 60 percent
  SCH->>SCH: mark Z3 unavailable and plan a drain
  loop each cycle until Z3 is drained
    SCH->>WL: PUT assignment with LOW priority first
    WL->>SIM: workload.assigned
  end
  SIM->>TEL: Z3 heat falls and temperature plateaus
  TEL->>TEL: alerts lowered or cleared